 到 $400","0ahUKEwjd3KOMxNKWAxWNoK8BHRt-EdwQ3YcHCHcoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjd3KOMxNKWAxWNoK8BHRt-EdwQ3IcHCHYoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjd3KOMxNKWAxWNoK8BHRt-EdwQ3IcHCHgoCg",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjd3KOMxNKWAxWNoK8BHRt-EdwQ3IcHCHkoCw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjd3KOMxNKWAxWNoK8BHRt-EdwQ3IcHCHooDA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["今天第一次來吃這家健康餐盒，整體體驗蠻不錯的。\n\n我點的是一份義大利麵搭配健康餐盒的組合。義大利麵口味清爽，不會太油膩，吃起來負擔不重，醬汁也剛好有入味，整體是偏清淡但不無聊的那種風格。\n\n配菜的部分蠻用心的，有花椰菜、玉米、櫛瓜、菇類、毛豆，還有半顆蛋，種類很多，顏色也很豐富，看起來就很健康。調味不會過重，吃得出食材本身的味道。\n\n肉的部分處理得不錯，不會乾柴，搭配蔬菜一起吃很剛好。\n\n整體份量對我來說剛好，有飽足感但不會太撐，很適合想吃健康一點、又不想太有負擔的時候來一份。\n\n店內環境小巧溫馨，菜單也蠻清楚的，選擇不少。\n\n如果之後想找清爽、均衡一點的餐點，應該還會再來。",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7488163371125999457/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTVms1dVRqRlZNSGhRVVZaYVFrMXVXbEJpUlRGc1lUSk5lR1Z0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7488163371125999457/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTVms1dVRqRlZNSGhRVVZaYVFrMXVXbEJpUlRGc1lUSk5lR1Z0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7488163371125999457/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTVms1dVRqRlZNSGhRVVZaYVFrMXVXbEJpUlRGc1lUSk5lR1Z0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7488163371125999457/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTVms1dVRqRlZNSGhRVVZaYVFrMXVXbEJpUlRGc1lUSk5lR1Z0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7488163371125999457/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTVms1dVRqRlZNSGhRVVZaYVFrMXVXbEJpUlRGc1lUSk5lR1Z0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/74881633